# Copy to backend/.env (or export in your shell) to unlock LIVE MODE.
#
# One Google Maps Platform key with these APIs enabled:
#   * Map Tiles API        (Photorealistic 3D Tiles for the Cesium scene)
#   * Routes API           (real driving directions + alternatives)
#   * Elevation API        (real terrain grid for the fire model's slope term)
# Restrict the key by HTTP referrer (http://localhost:5173/*) — the frontend
# uses it for 3D tiles, so treat it as a browser-class key.
# Google's monthly free tier comfortably covers demo usage; set quotas anyway.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Live wind (Open-Meteo) is keyless and on by default; set 1 to disable.
# DISABLE_LIVE_WIND=1
